  "description": {
   "en": "Graduate student Shin Kanghyuk has his thesis, something he dedicated years of hard work to, unjustly stolen by his own advisor, Lee Joontae, whom he once deeply respected.\nDue to the professor’s extensive connections in the academic community, Kanghyuk finds himself powerless to file a formal complaint or seek justice. But then, he stumbles upon the professor’s tablet, and inside it, videos of all kinds of perverted acts. Seeing this as the perfect leverage, Kanghyuk decides to use it to his advantage….\n“From now on, I’m going to make you my slave, Professor.”"
